          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "(a) Definitions. As used in this section:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.40.020 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "4345df7b-aa7f-59af-8fad-deec0b1a3a52",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 360,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:1",
          "start": 42
        },
        "quote": "“Replica” or “facsimile” means “imitation firearm,” as defined in K.S.A. 12-16,115 , and means a replica of a firearm which is so substantially similar in physical properties to an existing firearm as to lead a reasonable person to conclude that the replica is a firearm. The term “imitation firearm” does not include:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.40.020 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "99aefd50-d1ed-5205-92a9-68a4054b4cb1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 560,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:2",
          "start": 361
        },
        "quote": "(1) A nonfiring collector’s replica of an antique firearm which was designed prior to 1898, is historically significant and is offered for sale in conjunction with a wall plaque or presentation case;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.40.020 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "9a88ba90-77b0-5036-9af1-a360701d706d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 810,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:3",
          "start": 561
        },
        "quote": "(2) A nonfiring collector’s replica of a firearm which was designed after 1898, is historically significant, was issued as a commemorative by a nonprofit organization and is offered for sale in conjunction with a wall plaque or presentation case; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.40.020 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "1424b160-1adc-5608-8e4f-0a342c20e24b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 981,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:4",
          "start": 811
        },
        "quote": "(3) A pneumatic, spring, spring-air or compressed-gas powered nonpowdered gun that is commonly called an air gun and is designed to discharge BBs, pellets or paint balls.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.40.020 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "4be0f84b-5948-511b-b5a3-3342678d96c8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1203,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:5",
          "start": 982
        },
        "quote": "(b) It shall be unlawful for any person to draw, exhibit or brandish a replica or facsimile of a firearm in a rude, insolent, threatening or angry manner with the intent to frighten, vex, harass or annoy any other person.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.40.020 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "8da59e51-abce-55a3-a219-ba59ff056d37",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1443,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:6",
          "start": 1204
        },
        "quote": "(c) It shall be unlawful for any person to draw, exhibit or brandish a replica or facsimile of a firearm in the presence of a law enforcement officer, firefighter, emergency technician or paramedic engaged in the performance of his duties.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.40.020 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "d3f9f5c3-29be-5237-80aa-0ae4b491176b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1596,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:7",
          "start": 1444
        },
        "quote": "(d) Any replica or facsimile of a firearm used by any person in a rude, insolent, threatening or angry manner shall be seized and forfeited to the City.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.40.020 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "ec0f6fa6-cb93-5049-96d4-6e55a99c3d2a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1788,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:8",
          "start": 1597
        },
        "quote": "(e) Any person convicted of violating this section shall be deemed guilty of a misdemeanor and shall be punished by a fine of not less than $150.00. (Code 1981 § 15-93.1. Code 1995 § 54-104.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.40.020 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "b7156049-1de5-5412-8158-0ab1a644a6a3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1872,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:9",
          "start": 1789
        },
        "quote": "Cross References: Fire Department, TMC 2.20.030 ; Police Department, TMC 2.20.090 .",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.40.020:block:9#text",
